# A path on three axes (x, y, z in m) for the delta picker D3, from its start pose (0.1525, 0, -0.75): down, a quarter
# arc in the vertical x-z plane (end, centre, direction seen from -y), across, then a curve through two via points.
# See docs/user-guide.md, "Run a path and read path error" (paths on three axes).
line,0.1525,0.0,-0.80
arc,0.1025,0.0,-0.85,0.1025,0.0,-0.80,cw
line,-0.1,0.0,-0.85
spline,-0.15,0.05,-0.83
spline,-0.1,0.1,-0.80
line,0.0,0.1,-0.80
